*~

# Claude Code per-user runtime state (project doc is CLAUDE.md at root +
# per-project, anything else under .claude/ is local agent state)
**/.claude/

# Per-project VS Code workspace files (the shared multi-root config
# esp32_projects.code-workspace at repo root stays tracked).
PicoB/*.code-workspace
ESP32_C3/*.code-workspace
Hub_Server/*.code-workspace
Hub_Server_Firmware/*.code-workspace
Trip_Hub/*.code-workspace

# --- Showcase: keep real fleet data out of the public repo ---
# (files remain on disk locally; just not published). Runtime logs, the
# live SQLite DBs, and recorded GPS trips contain location data + paths.
Hub_Server/logs/*
!Hub_Server/logs/picoA_serial.log
Trip_Hub/trips.db
Trip_Hub/chat.db
Trip_Hub/deleted_trips.json
Trip_Hub/incoming/
# All recorded trips except two curated samples (one driving, one cycling).
PicoB/trips/*
!PicoB/trips/T1777725397.gps
!PicoB/trips/T1777725397.json
!PicoB/trips/T1777724727.gps
!PicoB/trips/T1777724727.json

# Local-only WIP / one-off diagnostics — not part of the showcase
Trip_Hub/_compare_trips.py
Trip_Hub/VERSION
